<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tracor cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tracor cut to outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Tracor Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares opened at 25-7/8, down 7/8 from previous close.</p>
</text>
